{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年31歲的《聲夢》出身歌手張馳豪（Aska），憑藉俊朗外形及1米85的高大身材，自2020年入行後備受力捧，除推出多首單曲外，亦參演《美麗戰場》、《反黑英雄》及《飛常日誌II》等重頭劇集，人氣持續上升。</p><p>然而，他日前在社交平台分享參與跑步活</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:24:07.064905+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:01:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:20.128503+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:20.128503+00:00","content_hash":"c318c9dcaf202ccee777f8ff13ff024d0ad2376576c3e64d5669b25aae18f1a0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}